WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:00,718
Oh no!

2
00:00:01,438 --> 00:00:03,717
A muddy blob is splashing the lemonade stand!

3
00:00:04,437 --> 00:00:06,867
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:07,587 --> 00:00:09,042
This is Episode 46.

5
00:00:09,762 --> 00:00:11,991
There is mud on the lemons and mud on the cups.

6
00:00:12,711 --> 00:00:13,478
Maya needs help.

7
00:00:14,198 --> 00:00:17,008
Here comes the sieve gate, with a little wall around the stand.

8
00:00:17,728 --> 00:00:20,495
The gate has one job: it checks everyone who knocks.

9
00:00:21,215 --> 00:00:22,941
Three little friends float up to the gate.

10
00:00:23,661 --> 00:00:25,473
The gate looks, and swings open.

11
00:00:26,193 --> 00:00:27,251
Come in, friends!

12
00:00:27,971 --> 00:00:29,590
Now the blob charges at the gate.

13
00:00:30,310 --> 00:00:31,956
The gate looks, and shuts tight.

14
00:00:32,676 --> 00:00:33,097
Bounce!

15
00:00:33,817 --> 00:00:34,211
Splat!

16
00:00:34,931 --> 00:00:35,710
Nothing gets in.

17
00:00:36,430 --> 00:00:38,310
The blob puts on a hat and tries again.

18
00:00:39,030 --> 00:00:39,490
Sneaky!

19
00:00:40,210 --> 00:00:41,230
The gate is not fooled.

20
00:00:41,950 --> 00:00:42,546
Still shut.

21
00:00:43,266 --> 00:00:43,934
Friends get in.

22
00:00:44,654 --> 00:00:46,615
Mud stays out, every single time.

23
00:00:47,335 --> 00:00:48,284
That is the sieve gate.

24
00:00:49,004 --> 00:00:50,926
It checks who is knocking before they get in.

25
00:00:51,646 --> 00:00:52,922
Now you know WAF!

26
00:00:53,642 --> 00:00:55,425
Check out the Cloud Town book series.

27
00:00:56,145 --> 00:00:56,982
Link in the bio.

28
00:00:57,702 --> 00:00:58,585
See you next time!

